<INFO BITRATE="192000" GENRE="Pop" COMMENT="Please pass this song around - FREE! Spread the word, you've gotta educate yourself in truth :)  Google &quot;Free Bees&quot;, Google &quot;911 Truth&quot;" KEY_LYRICS="Free Bees - 9/11's A Lie (Stayin' Alive) 2008    Well you can tell by the way the buildings fell  There was something wrong, now it's time to tell  Spread the word it's nothing new  You gotta educate yourself in truth.    Well it's not alright, its not okay,  For you to look the other way,  We can help you understand,   The New York times effect on man.    Whether youre a brother or whether youre a mother,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Neocon's are shaking, the world has started waking,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie...    Well, we can't give in, we can't let go,  If we want to see some justice flow.  Its time for us to make stand,  And together we can end this plan.    It's not alright okay, it's not okay,  For you to look the other way.  The wars they fight, just aint right,  I dont know how they sleep at night.    Whether youre a brother or whether youre a mother,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Neocon's are shaking, the world has started waking,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie...    Were getting stronger, wont take much longer,  The truth will set us free.    Lets break our silence, no need for violence,  Become the change we want to see.    We need a peaceful revolution,  We need to know we have a choice,  We've let them get away with murder,  It's time for us to find out voice.    Whether youre a brother or whether youre a mother,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Neocons are shaking, the world has started waking,  911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie, 911 a lie.  Ah-ah-ah-ah 911s a lie...  " COVERARTID="106/KDR2I1C2XZSREA5KGTG0DTHFIRBC" KEY="Gbm" PLAYTIME="196" PLAYTIME_FLOAT="195.944489" RANKING="255" IMPORT_DATE="2021/7/21" RELEASE_DATE="2008/1/1" FILESIZE="4729"></INFO>
